--------------------- CableDyn Input File ------------------------------------
C API host-coupling test deck: one EI=0 chain and one finite-EI cable, each from its own
Coupled fairlead to a Fixed anchor on a 50 m flat seabed. The finite-EI line puts the deck on
the coupled aggregate (fixed step dtM); the two sub-objects make every step a staged step.
